{"completed": true, "response": "既然还不知道自己到底在怕什么，他就不急着决定这份在意该走向哪里。他现在不需要知道两个人以后会怎样，也不需要因为喜欢对方，就期待对方给自己什么。这样想着，他渐渐能够安心地和那个人亲近了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。心里有一份温柔，可以自由地给出去，不用总是确认对方有没有接受，也不用因为对方对自己很重要，就变得不再从容。有时候，他甚至觉得自己比以前更自在了。原来，让一个人走进心里，不一定会让自己感到不安；他可以认真地在乎对方，却不必紧紧抓住什么。\n\n这份快乐确实让他感到安心。他慢慢不再防备自己的喜欢，甚至有些满意自己能够这样宽容、平和地对待这份感情。如果两个人能够一直这样自然而然地亲近，不用追问，也不用计较，那该多好。当时他觉得，这样就已经足够了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1bbfd09f-d354-486d-87e0-c1fc620752c3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002151062160Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.656, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:21:59.719840+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "546626af8388d021b7fac64fdde6667da0495e7a8bd8a7b87419207b3d41c429", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002151062160Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5a52d163e8acee803287338e87999c37b495ffa1bed192e44049485726a62017"}}}
